        "TileImage": "$($repository a7d355c3-e4e6-49b7-8a6e-f229801e4e3e).Image",
        "Description": "Agent 47 recently completed his internship, and he can now finally call himself a medic. To much of his dismay, the medical crew is ignoring the mandatory rules regarding social-distancing. The former assassin can&apos;t let this slide, and he is looking to punish the medics that are responsible for this lackluster attitude. Of course, they point to Sierra Know as she&apos;s the one that is promoting this kind of behavior. Agent 47 is playing by the book, and he will not tolerate this.",
